{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "03034",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 1.08,
      "end_seconds": 9.58,
      "duration_seconds": 8.5,
      "text": "Hello, take a seat, I'll be with you in a second. Is the form from the front desk all filled in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.21,
      "end_seconds": 16.77,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "I think so, I handed it in at the counter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 18.74,
      "end_seconds": 21.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "How are things, what's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 21.91,
      "end_seconds": 29.26,
      "duration_seconds": 7.35,
      "text": "Yeah, it's sudden breathlessness five days after surgery. I don't know what's causing it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.76,
      "end_seconds": 32.49,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Do you take any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.53,
      "end_seconds": 36.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "No, I don't take any tablets."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 37.64,
      "end_seconds": 38.82,
      "duration_seconds": 1.18,
      "text": "Since when exactly?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.57,
      "end_seconds": 44.31,
      "duration_seconds": 3.74,
      "text": "It's been ten days, I'm fairly sure."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.65,
      "end_seconds": 47.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.5,
      "text": "Ah. How frequently does it come?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.3,
      "end_seconds": 50.24,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "It's on and off."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.9,
      "end_seconds": 53.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.33,
      "text": "Is it accompanied by anything?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.61,
      "end_seconds": 67.48,
      "duration_seconds": 12.87,
      "text": "It usually comes with a racing heart. The racing heart? That's been for one week. About racing heart, it's a few times a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 68.0,
      "end_seconds": 71.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.17,
      "text": "Did you notice any coughing up blood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 74.87,
      "end_seconds": 77.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "No, no coughing up blood."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 81.46,
      "end_seconds": 83.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "Any fever or wound problem?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 85.59,
      "end_seconds": 88.23,
      "duration_seconds": 2.64,
      "text": "No, none that I've noticed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.19,
      "end_seconds": 93.66,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 94.42,
      "end_seconds": 96.33,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "No, joints are fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.92,
      "end_seconds": 111.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.04,
      "text": "Alright, any medical conditions, anything you've been treated for?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 112.86,
      "end_seconds": 116.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.31,
      "text": "No, nothing I can think of."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.37,
      "end_seconds": 131.58,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "Are you allergic to anything? Any allergies to medicines or foods?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 133.15,
      "end_seconds": 136.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "I don't think I have any, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 137.98,
      "end_seconds": 139.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.41,
      "text": "Are you active?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 140.02,
      "end_seconds": 143.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "I walk the dog every morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 144.22,
      "end_seconds": 147.65,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Are you on your own at home?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 148.26,
      "end_seconds": 151.6,
      "duration_seconds": 3.34,
      "text": "I live with my elderly mother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.43,
      "end_seconds": 159.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "What line of work are you in?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 160.1,
      "end_seconds": 165.66,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "I'm a bus driver, so I sit for long hours."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 167.11,
      "end_seconds": 169.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Have you had any previous surgeries?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 171.95,
      "end_seconds": 174.85,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Nothing, I haven't had any operations."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 192.87,
      "end_seconds": 195.96,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Time for your numbers, if that's okay."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.73,
      "end_seconds": 209.3,
      "duration_seconds": 2.57,
      "text": "Keep your arm relaxed for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.55,
      "end_seconds": 228.48,
      "duration_seconds": 8.93,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 25, SpO2 89 percent on room air. And temp 36.9 degrees, BP is 131 over 84, pulse 99."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 229.66,
      "end_seconds": 231.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.37,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 232.11,
      "end_seconds": 234.13,
      "duration_seconds": 2.02,
      "text": "We'll go over that shortly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 236.06,
      "end_seconds": 240.51,
      "duration_seconds": 4.45,
      "text": "I'll examine you in a second, make yourself comfortable."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.47,
      "end_seconds": 245.37,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Take a deep breath for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 254.93,
      "end_seconds": 260.68,
      "duration_seconds": 5.75,
      "text": "Your left calf is swollen and tender and your oxygen is low."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.81,
      "end_seconds": 266.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Thank you, you can get dressed."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 283.3,
      "end_seconds": 300.67,
      "duration_seconds": 17.37,
      "text": "From what you've told me and what I found, it's hard to say. A possible blood clot in the lung after surgery is one possibility and a chest infection another, and I'd rather not commit yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.1,
      "end_seconds": 307.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "What are the odds it's serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 311.87,
      "end_seconds": 329.61,
      "duration_seconds": 17.74,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a possible blood clot in the lung after surgery, and we'll know more once the a CT pulmonary angiogram is back. I'll request a CT pulmonary angiogram, it'll help with possible pulmonary embolus."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 331.32,
      "end_seconds": 333.94,
      "duration_seconds": 2.62,
      "text": "When would that take place?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 335.36,
      "end_seconds": 371.9,
      "duration_seconds": 36.54,
      "text": "What I'm giving you is enoxaparin, 1.5 mg per kg, once now, single dose. That should help with possible clot. Please go to hospital now, I will call ahead. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference. Let's hold off on a D-dimer for now, and if there's no change in a month we can revisit it. That's everything on my side. Anything you're unsure about?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 373.52,
      "end_seconds": 376.98,
      "duration_seconds": 3.46,
      "text": "Okay, that makes sense. Thanks for explaining."
    }
  ]
}